EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}It's kind of awkward to say this to
your face since you're the mayor
and all, but{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I've been {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}feeling more and more like{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
this town just isn't run properly.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Yup, I've hit my limit!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}So the next time an election comes
up,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} I'm going to run for mayor!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Heh. Whaddya think of that?{{TAG:0008:0000:0400000005000000}}
Knock it off!
That's a lie, right?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}No es fácil decir esto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} pero es que
no me lo puedo callar más.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Cada vez estoy más convencido
de que este pueblo no funciona
como es debido.
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}¡Y hasta aquí hemos llegado!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}
¡En las próximas elecciones,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
me pienso presentar a alcalde!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hala, ya lo he dicho.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¿Qué te parece?{{TAG:0008:0000:0400000005000000}}
¡Vete a paseo!
Es un chiste, ¿no?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}È un po' imbarazzante, ma devo
dirtelo in faccia. Vedi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ultimamente {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ho sempre più
l'impressione che questa città{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
non sia gestita nel modo migliore.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ho finito la pazienza da un pezzo!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Quindi, per le prossime elezioni,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
mi candiderò alla carica di sindaco!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Beh, che mi dici?{{TAG:0008:0000:0400000005000000}}
Ma lascia perdere!
Stai scherzando, vero?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sen başkansın diye yüzüne söylemesi
biraz garip ama{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bu kasabanın {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}giderek daha kötü yönetildiğini{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
düşünmeye başladım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Evet, sabrım taştı!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bir sonraki seçimde{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} başkanlığa aday olacağım!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Heh. Buna ne diyorsun?{{TAG:0008:0000:0400000005000000}}
Hadi oradan!
Yalan, değil mi?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Per dare il mio contributo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ho deciso di candidarmi alla carica
di sindaco di {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ma mi raccomando! Non dirlo
al sindaco {{TAG:0005:001C:00CD}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Mi voterai alle prossime elezioni?{{TAG:0008:0000:0600000007000000}}
Buona fortuna!
Stai scherzando, vero?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Bu kasabayı daha da geliştirmek için{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} başkanlığına adaylığımı açıklıyorum!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ama Başkan {{TAG:0005:001C:00CD}}'dan gizli tut!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}
Seçimde oyuna güvenebilir miyim?{{TAG:0008:0000:0600000007000000}}
Bol şans!
Yalan, değil mi?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Did you think I was serious?!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Of course I was just kidding!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It's {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}April Fools' {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}after all!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Like I'd ever take a job where I had
to DO something. What do I look
like?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Te has molestado?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Pero si estaba de guasa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿No ves
que es el Día de las Bromas?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¿Cómo iba a quitarte el trabajo?
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Si yo ya estoy para jubilarme!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Pensavi che stessi dicendo
